   Eltigani, Amna; Krause, Ariane, Leibniz Inst Vegetable \& Ornamental Crops IGZ, Programme area Next Generat Hort Syst HORTSYS, DE-14979 Grossbeeren, Germany.
   Olsson, Alexander, KTH Royal Inst Technol, Div Energy Proc, SE-10044 Stockholm, Sweden.
   Ernest, Baraka; Yanda, Pius, Univ Dar es Salaam, Inst Resource Assessment, POB 35091, Dar Es Salaam, Tanzania.
