   Wang, Chong; Wu, Huixian; Han, Gye Won; Katritch, Vsevolod; Cherezov, Vadim; Stevens, Raymond C., Scripps Res Inst, Dept Integrat Struct \& Computat Biol, La Jolla, CA 92037 USA.
